        "content": "<p>jrandolf opened <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/issues/14853\">issue #14853</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>When an outer component instantiates an inner one, the instance passed for an inner import isn't re-typed to the inner component's declared import type. If the inner component re-exports that import, the re-export takes its type and attributes from the outer argument:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"WebAssembly\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"err\">component</span>\n  <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"err\">core</span> <span class=\"k\">module</span> <span class=\"nv\">$m</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">func</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">export</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"f\"</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">result</span> <span class=\"kt\">i32</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"nb\">i32.const</span> <span class=\"mi\">7</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n  <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"err\">core</span> <span class=\"err\">instance</span> <span class=\"nv\">$i</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"err\">instantiate</span> <span class=\"nv\">$m</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n  <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">func</span> <span class=\"nv\">$f</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">result</span> <span class=\"err\">u</span><span class=\"mi\">32</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"err\">canon</span> <span class=\"err\">l</span><span class=\"nb\">if</span><span class=\"err\">t</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"err\">core</span> <span class=\"k\">func</span> <span class=\"nv\">$i</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"f\"</span><span class=\"p\">)))</span>\n  <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"err\">instance</span> <span class=\"nv\">$n</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n  <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"err\">instance</span> <span class=\"nv\">$arg</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">export</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"n\"</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"err\">implements</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"p:q/r\"</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"err\">instance</span> <span class=\"nv\">$n</span><span class=\"p\">))</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">export</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"extra\"</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">func</span> <span class=\"nv\">$f</span><span class=\"p\">)))</span>\n  <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"err\">component</span> <span class=\"nv\">$inner</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">import</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"x\"</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"err\">instance</span> <span class=\"nv\">$x</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">export</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"n\"</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"err\">implements</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"x:y/z\"</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"err\">instance</span><span class=\"p\">))))</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">export</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"y\"</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"err\">instance</span> <span class=\"nv\">$x</span><span class=\"p\">)))</span>\n  <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"err\">instance</span> <span class=\"nv\">$inst</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"err\">instantiate</span> <span class=\"nv\">$inner</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"err\">with</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"x\"</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"err\">instance</span> <span class=\"nv\">$arg</span><span class=\"p\">))))</span>\n  <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">export</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"out\"</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"err\">instance</span> <span class=\"nv\">$inst</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"y\"</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n<span class=\"p\">)</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>Wasmtime reports <code>out/n</code> as implementing <code>p:q/r</code> (the inner component declared <code>x:y/z</code>), and <code>out</code> has an <code>extra</code> export that the inner component never declared and that the host can look up. wasmparser's types for the same component have <code>n</code> implementing <code>x:y/z</code> and no <code>extra</code>.</p>\n<p>The argument seems to be pushed as-is in <code>inline.rs</code> (<code>frame.push_item(arg.clone())</code>), and <code>record_export</code> then takes nested attributes from the outer type.<br>\n</p>\n</blockquote>",
